# Prompt Runtime Governance

- Read `docs-governance/canonical/PROMPT_RUNTIME_GOVERNANCE.md` before changing prompts or prompt assembly.
- Do not place raw system prompt strings in UI components, route files, or domain handlers.
- User-facing behavior controls must remain structured inputs, not direct compiled prompt editing.
- Prompt changes should flow through templates/fragments/compiler and be reviewable like code.
